# 170 "data/maps/DavosiStraits/scripts.pory"
	.string "Ehehe, you made it, {PLAYER}! The\n"
	.string "{COLOR GREEN}Ruins of Ahiyawa{COLOR DARK_GRAY}, the new home of the\l"
	.string "{COLOR GREEN}Elite Four{COLOR DARK_GRAY}, lies just ahead of us.\p"
	.string "We've come so far from Acrisia City...\n"
	.string "And look how much we've grown! I\l"
	.string "started out with a Bellsprout I found\l"
	.string "in my backyard, and now it's a\l"
	.string "Victreebel, ready to {COLOR GREEN}Mega Evolve{COLOR DARK_GRAY} and\l"
	.string "demolish your team.\p"
	.string "Whoops, did I say that out loud?\n"
	.string "Kahaha! Come on, let's battle!$"

